      "observed": "On the CAN BUS sheet, the isolated CAN transceivers U11 and U10 have both of their isolated ground pins connected to the same global GND: U11.GND1 (pin 4) and U11.GND2 (pin 5) are tied to GND, and U10.GND1 (pin 4) and U10.GND2 (pin 5) are also tied to GND.",
