          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Motor/actuator interfaces: two isolated CAN buses (CAN0, CAN1), each driven by its own MCP2515 SPI CAN controller (U8, U9) through an isolated CAN transceiver (U11/companion)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The intended galvanic isolation of the CAN buses is defeated, creating ground loops and removing the isolation/protection that the isolated CAN transceiver topology was intended to provide for the motor/actuator interfaces.",
